## Quick reference

| What | Where |
|---|---|
| Pages themselves | the `.html` files at the root |
| Shared styles/scripts/logo | `assets/` |
| App icons (for "Install app") | `assets/icons/` |
| Installability config | `manifest.json` |
| Offline/install support | `sw.js` |
| Backend contact form handler | `functions/api/contact.js` |
| Backend AI stub (unused for now) | `functions/api/ai-assistant.js` |
| Database table definition | `schema.sql` |
                   
